# Local Claude Code state. Everyone who works on this repo runs Claude Code
# inside it, and settings.local.json carries absolute home paths, MCP server
# names and permission allowlists. Do not rely on a machine-global ignore for
# this — a fresh clone does not have one.
.claude/

